        "content": "CPU is in logical cores (1.0 = one core). Memory and storage are bytes; the limit line is the Panel allocation and unlimited servers have no limit line. 'Limit / current used' is elapsed headroom (max limit / current use), colored: dark-red below 10%, red below 20%, orange below 35%, yellow below 60%, else green. Node health describes Panel-to-Wings API polling; disk sample age is unknown because Wings caches disk use. Collection, scraping, and dashboard refresh are independent; gaps mean missing or stale data, not zero."
